.TH SKOGAI-MODULE-ENV 1  "skogai-module-env 0.0.0" 
.SH NAME
skogai\-module\-env \- the env a module's command runs with, as export lines
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskogai module env\fR <NAME>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.br
the env a module's command runs with, as export lines
.br

.br
SKOGAI_MODULE, SKOGAI_MODULE_DIR, SKOGAI_LOCAL_DIR and SKOGAI_CONFIG_DIR
.br
(both absolute), and the module's own resolved keys: runner.model is
.br
SKOGAI_RUNNER_MODEL.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR

.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

.SH "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES:"
.TP
\fISKOGAI_SYSTEM_DIR\fR [default: /etc/skogai]
.br
dir of the system layer config
.TP
\fISKOGAI_CONFIG_DIR\fR
.br
dir of the global layer, default ~/.config/skogai
.TP
\fISKOGAI_LOCAL_DIR\fR [default: .skogai]
.br
dir of the local layer; relative is from the git root, or pwd
.TP
\fISKOGAI_MODULE_PATH\fR
.br
colon\-separated dirs of module sources, default the one this module sits in
